{"lyrics":"[00:03.32] I'm high as hell on this shit, man\n[00:04.60] (TAMALHI)\n[00:08.24] Juice, what up, man?\n[00:10.24] I know you rollin' off them pills\n[00:15.68] I'm finna tweak on this bitch, man, ha\n[00:19.46] Gang shit though\n[00:22.74] I-I-I spaz on the track, y'all niggas so wack (Go crazy)\n[00:24.64] In the booth turnt up, then Juice up next\n[00:26.52] Ring, ring on my line, yo' bitch wanna sext\n[00:28.30] I don't ever call back, hell nah, just text (Yeah-yeah)\n[00:30.30] I'm a young ass nigga and I swung so blessed\n[00:32.14] Won't ever be broke, smoke dope for the stress\n[00:34.02] Yeah, I'm 'bout that life, I don't even need hoes (Hell nah)\n[00:35.96] Left hook, right hook, knock a nigga out his soul\n[00:37.82] I just wanna get rich, gettin' money is the goal\n[00:39.70] Want a foreign ass whip with a bitch that's gold\n[00:41.56] With a fat ass crib, one of these count rolls\n[00:43.46] I need fame and bread, school shit gettin' old\n[00:45.34] Like woah, I'ma get the money then go (Woo)\n[00:47.18] Pass the bitch like a give and go (Woah)\n[00:48.74] I'm on a roll, I just want dough (Woah)\n[00:50.70] I told you niggas what the fuck that I'm on (Woah)\n[00:52.66] All of my niggas be rollin', these bitches be rollin'\n[00:54.80] They rollin' wit' us and we goin' (Woah)\n[00:56.44] All my niggas they gon' blow on that strong (Bah)\n[00:58.30] Got a gun on me so my life is long, woah (Grrah)\n[01:00.74] Told I’m the man, don't forget it (Woah)\n[01:02.04] Boy, I swear to god, I'ma aim at his vision (Yeah)\n[01:03.76] In the cut, give a fuck, hell nah, we scissors (Nah)\n[01:05.84] Abracadabra, I turn to the wizard (Woo)\n[01:07.72] Freestyle shit I don't even gotta write it (Nah)\n[01:09.60] I can see the future like a mu-fuckin' psychic (Yeah)\n[01:11.52] Girl gonna ride my dick like a bike (Woah)\n[01:13.32] She a lil' ass bitch, call that shit Little Tike (Swoo)\n[01:15.22] Mu-fucka', yo' girl that shit I like (Yeah)\n[01:17.46] Boy, told you I'm in it for real, duh\n[01:19.60] All of my niggas be rollin', I swear I be Romeo, I pop me a pill though (Alright)\n[01:23.40] All of my niggas go crazy (Yeah)\n[01:25.36] What the fuck is you on? (The fuck?)\n[01:27.40] All of these niggas be lazy (Uh-huh)\n[01:28.82] But there's millions on my futon (Futon, ayy)\n[01:30.32] Millions on my futon, yeah, JuiceTheKidd\n[01:32.80] Ayy-ayy, look\n[01:36.76] (Finish Him!)\n[01:38.70] Uh, I'm goin', these hoes, they be goin', they already know it (Swoo)\n[01:42.38] Co-Coke in the air, told yo' girl it was snowin' (Swoo)\n[01:44.36] All of these bitches ain't loyal, they hoin' (Swoo)\n[01:46.26] Fuck is you talkin' 'bout, all of my niggas, they ballin' (Yeah)\n[01:48.50] Swear that they ballin' like Spalding (Yeah)\n[01:49.92] Taught you to auction (Yeah)\n[01:50.92] Gettin' money, boy, I'm doin' these verses, the highest the offer (Swoo)\n[01:53.76] Look, boy I get high, me touch the sky\n[01:56.08] I'm too fly, girls kissin' girls, I swear that they bi' (Woah)\n[01:58.86] And then after I fuck, I tell they ass, \"Bye\" (Bye)\n[02:00.86] Any nigga wanna come get it, I got it (Woah)\n[02:02.66] Don't forget it, I'm rolling up pot, It's blurry ass vision\n[02:05.40] I swear these niggas talk dumb till I pull it out, shoot on the spot (Bah)\n[02:08.38] Any nigga wanna come get it, we gone (True)\n[02:10.60] I get this shit, then I'm gone (True)\n[02:12.56] I'm out workin' all night and I do this rappin' shit on my own (I do)\n[02:15.76] I mean shout out to my nigga Zay (That's gang)\n[02:18.06] You know that's the game though (Yeah-yeah)\n[02:20.02] And I feel like Future all day, 'cause when I turn up I get on beast mode (Woah-woah)\n[02:24.00] Sick of this rap game, getting used to these cheat codes (Swoo)\n[02:27.60] My Glock sing all day, bitch, I ain't even talkin' 'bout Glee though (That's true)\n[02:31.42] Stitch 'em up like Lilo (Woah)\n[02:33.34] Run up on me, that's some dumb shit (Bah)\n[02:35.10] These niggas talkin', they just startin' rumors, but these bitches follow by assumptions (Dummy)\n[02:38.96] And I'm just tryna get this money (Yeah)\n[02:40.88] I get the money like it's nothing (True)\n[02:42.72] It's Halloween when I come around, mask on, we is Smashing Pumpkin (Bah)\n[02:46.86] F' everything, nigga I ain't even talkin' 'bout that I'm flunkin' (Dummy)\n[02:50.28] But all these niggas stupid, boy I'm A1, all these other niggas flunkin'(Woah)","words":[[3.32,3.4,"I'm"],[3.48,3.72,"high"],[3.76,3.8,"as"],[3.84,3.96,"hell"],[4.0,4.1,"on"],[4.14,4.24,"this"],[4.32,4.48,"shit,"],[4.52,4.56,"man"],[4.6,4.74,"(TAMALHI)"],[8.24,8.46,"Juice,"],[8.5,8.62,"what"],[8.72,8.76,"up,"],[8.82,8.92,"man?"],[10.24,10.24,"I"],[10.28,10.38,"know"],[10.46,10.5,"you"],[10.58,10.84,"rollin'"],[10.88,10.94,"off"],[10.98,11.1,"them"],[11.16,11.5,"pills"],[15.68,15.72,"I'm"],[15.78,15.96,"finna"],[16.02,16.26,"tweak"],[16.32,16.42,"on"],[16.56,16.62,"this"],[16.66,16.84,"bitch,"],[16.9,17.06,"man,"],[17.1,17.12,"ha"],[19.46,19.7,"Gang"],[19.74,19.86,"shit"],[19.94,20.16,"though"],[22.74,22.82,"I-I-I"],[22.86,23.16,"spaz"],[23.24,23.28,"on"],[23.32,23.36,"the"],[23.4,23.62,"track,"],[23.7,23.84,"y'all"],[23.88,24.06,"niggas"],[24.12,24.18,"so"],[24.26,24.32,"wack"],[24.36,24.44,"(Go"],[24.48,24.6,"crazy)"],[24.64,24.66,"In"],[24.7,24.74,"the"],[24.84,25.0,"booth"],[25.04,25.26,"turnt"],[25.36,25.44,"up,"],[25.52,25.68,"then"],[25.76,25.94,"Juice"],[26.06,26.16,"up"],[26.26,26.44,"next"],[26.52,26.66,"Ring,"],[26.74,26.9,"ring"],[26.96,27.0,"on"],[27.04,27.06,"my"],[27.18,27.36,"line,"],[27.4,27.52,"yo'"],[27.64,27.8,"bitch"],[27.84,27.98,"wanna"],[28.08,28.26,"sext"],[28.3,28.3,"I"],[28.34,28.46,"don't"],[28.58,28.72,"ever"],[28.78,28.96,"call"],[29.06,29.22,"back,"],[29.3,29.42,"hell"],[29.52,29.7,"nah,"],[29.74,29.9,"just"],[29.94,30.0,"text"],[30.04,30.24,"(Yeah-yeah)"],[30.3,30.34,"I'm"],[30.38,30.38,"a"],[30.46,30.72,"young"],[30.8,30.9,"ass"],[30.98,31.14,"nigga"],[31.18,31.2